WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0120: WoW's music follows the character the player controls.
tav.bin flags bit 4 (controlled character in a BG3 fight, MusicRule.lua) decides the yield, in place of
the hero's flag and any fight of the party's (0102's in_fight): a companion or a summon fighting elsewhere
no longer stops WoW's track. Bit 8 (BG3's fight music shut): control left a running fight, so WoW's track
starts at once instead of 8 s later, which is for BG3's win stinger.
